{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are the Keeper of the Dead. Every night you need to light up all the Shrines in the graveyard. But it won't be as simple as striking a match. The dead are restless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654410/extras/AboutGif.gif?t=1744344106\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cards for the Dead:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your Deck of Actions Cards to help you keep the graveyard quiet... and to exploit it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654410/extras/Cards.png?t=1744344106\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Craft solutions to your problems:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather various ingredients scattered around the graveyard to craft items you need to assist you every night with Shrines and the restless inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654410/extras/Craft.png?t=1744344106\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless rows of graves</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your resources wisely in an ever expanding graveyard that is bringing more problems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654410/extras/Rows.png?t=1744344106\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3654410?t=1744344106","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654410/7c1679bf243f83f03956c738103e423496ad233a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744344106","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654410/e3869fd883dd697e535e3624259dda081dd35ecc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744344106","capsule_i